    meaning: "A project that looks impossible can become possible when one team has clear control, its own money and a fixed deadline.",
    extra: ["The Karbude tunnel near Ratnagiri is about 6.5 km long.", "Seventy-four workers lost their lives during construction.", "Sreedharan later led the building of the Delhi Metro and came to be called the ‘Metro Man’."],
